{"id":"651869","name":"菠萝炒饭","author":"五加五左左","authorId":"11514294","desc":"","cover":"images/651869/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"米饭","amount":"1碗"},{"name":"菠萝","amount":"半个"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"玉米","amount":"100g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备食材。","img":"images/651869/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"菠萝切成块，打一个鸡蛋黄到米饭里，另一个鸡蛋和蛋清搅散。","img":"images/651869/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"把蛋黄和米饭充分混合。","img":"images/651869/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"起锅热油打入鸡蛋液。","img":"images/651869/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"鸡蛋炒到半熟搅散，倒入玉米粒炒熟。","img":"images/651869/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"盛出鸡蛋和玉米，备用。","img":"images/651869/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"少油润锅，倒入米饭。","img":"images/651869/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"中火煸炒，把米饭炒干。","img":"images/651869/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"米饭炒干以后，倒入菠萝。","img":"images/651869/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"炒出汁水以后，倒入鸡蛋和玉米。","img":"images/651869/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加一点盐出锅。","img":"images/651869/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}